  "description": "The Bubble Sketch Font is a cute, playful, and hand-drawn outline typeface designed to add a sketchy, doodle-inspired charm to your creative projects! With its whimsical, outlined letters and artistic personality, this font is perfect for Cricut, Silhouette, Procreate, Canva, and all digital design platforms. Whether you’re creating stickers, t-shirts, posters, greeting cards, school projects, or social media graphics, Bubble Sketch adds a fun and unique touch to every design.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>The Bubble Sketch Font is a cute, playful, and hand-drawn outline typeface designed to add a sketchy, doodle-inspired charm to your creative projects! With its whimsical, outlined letters and artistic personality, this font is perfect for Cricut, Silhouette, Procreate, Canva, and all digital design platforms. Whether you’re creating stickers, t-shirts, posters, greeting cards, school projects, or social media graphics, Bubble Sketch adds a fun and unique touch to every design.</p>",
